# "Otherwise, you may play that card this turn": without a completed dungeon the exiled Lightning Bolt must be paid for, and only until end of turn.
# (The library is all Lightning Bolts after Secret Entrance's search shuffles it, so what is drawn and exiled is fixed.)
# Bot1's Adventurer attacks on turn 3 and exiles the Bolt. Bot1 does not cast it that turn, and on turn 5 it can't (the refusal). The same card is cast
# for {R} in the other scenario (caves-of-chaos-adventurer-pays-the-mana-cost-of-the-spell-it-exiles).

